The Quality Tea Frontend - CI
-----------------------------
This repository contains build scripts for The Quality Tea Frontend,
a classic WIMP emulator frontend which lives here:
 https://gitlab.com/jgemu/qtea

QTea may be linked against emulator cores using The Jolly Good API:
  https://gitlab.com/jgemu

The result is what feels like a traditional standalone emulator, using a
whitelabel frontend. This repository is used to perform binary releases.
